</groundspeak:short_description><groundspeak:long_description>&lt;p&gt;Turningbridge Park is located in Liberty Township, Butler County, and is a 45-acre park. This nice paved walking trail runs along Gregory Creek. A video of the trial can be seen on the &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4IwCUj4rFxw"&gt;liberty-township.com website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
