</groundspeak:long_description><groundspeak:encoded_hints /><groundspeak:logs><groundspeak:log id="1332940981"><groundspeak:date>2025-11-02T15:38:24</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="13392912">AragornXX1</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Really cool!  TFTC</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1322746666"><groundspeak:date>2025-09-06T13:53:58</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="5649378">DRJDSmith</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">After a great day golfing with my buddy, I wanted to snag a few caches before heading home. I went after the three along this bike path, but was only able to find two. Enjoyed walking the bike path and getting some steps. 

